00:00:00.336 --> 00:00:03.534 line:90%
I'm Dwight Howard, and my favorite
movie is <i>Finding Nemo</i>.

00:00:07.254 --> 00:00:09.348 line:10%
<i>Man, I've probably seen it
200 times,</i>

00:00:09.373 --> 00:00:12.349 line:10%
