00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:33.519 line:90%
<i>you know, also.
And I end up making it.</i>

00:00:33.929 --> 00:00:36.139 line:90%
<i>You know, I was, I'm
a blessing to be here.</i>

00:00:36.477 --> 00:00:38.877 line:90%
<i>That's why I can really relate
to that movie.</i>

00:00:38.902 --> 00:00:43.009 line:90%
MARLIN: I will never let anything
happen to you... Nemo.

00:00:43.212 --> 00:00:44.695 line:90%
It's a genuine movie for me.

00:00:44.877 --> 00:00:46.015 line:90%
PRODUCER: You are Nemo!

00:00:46.184 --> 00:00:47.437 line:90%
(LAUGHING)

00:00:47.437 --> 00:00:49.462 line:90%
I'm not Nemo, I don't have
a little flipper.

00:00:49.462 --> 00:00:50.223 line:90%
(CHUCKLING)

00:00:50.496 --> 00:00:53.342 line:90%
<i>And I love that movie because all
the different characters</i>

00:00:53.342 --> 00:00:54.341 line:90%
<i>and stuff like that.</i>

00:00:54.341 --> 00:00:55.634 line:90%
DORY: Do you, do you, do you?

00:00:55.634 --> 00:00:59.014 line:90%
It's like, "Hello, my name is Bruce."
"Hi, Bruce."

00:00:59.014 --> 00:01:01.215 line:90%
BRUCE: Hello, my name is Bruce.

00:01:01.215 --> 00:01:02.460 line:90%
Hello, Bruce.

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:04.352 line:90%
BRUCE: Fish are friends, not food.

00:01:04.352 --> 00:01:06.939 line:90%
Fish are friends, not food.

00:01:06.939 --> 00:01:10.550 line:90%
I'm in high school and I'm about
to enter the NBA draft

00:01:10.974 --> 00:01:14.892 line:90%
and, uh, I remember being at
the McDonald's game

00:01:14.892 --> 00:01:17.924 line:90%
and, you know, all the guys there
used to always make fun of me

00:01:17.924 --> 00:01:20.024 line:90%
