was my favorite movie.

00:01:20.431 --> 00:01:22.492 line:90%
And I would always say,
"Just keep swimming."

00:01:22.492 --> 00:01:26.935 line:90%
So anytime anybody saw me
and I was in a bad mood,

00:01:27.246 --> 00:01:30.292 line:90%
I wasn't smiling, they'd say,
"Dwight, just keep swimming."

00:01:30.577 --> 00:01:34.007 line:90%
And then everybody would say, "Just
keep swimming, just keep swimming."

00:01:34.007 --> 00:01:35.910 line:90%
♪ (SINGING) ♪
<i>"What do you do? You swim!"</i>

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:38.360 line:90%
♪ (SINGING) ♪
DORY: <i>Oo, oo, I love to swim--</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:42.236 line:90%
I would say, for me, coming
from where I came from,

00:01:42.236 --> 00:01:45.436 line:90%
