00:01:45.886 --> 00:01:48.815 line:90%
<i>You know, this atmosphere of love.</i>

00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:50.780 line:90%
<i>You know, where it was just us.</i>

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:54.162 line:90%
