00:02:24.888 --> 00:02:26.783 line:90%
You know, and this
is his only son.

00:02:26.783 --> 00:02:29.943 line:90%
This is the only thing
that he has of his life.

00:02:30.401 --> 00:02:33.401 line:90%
<i>You know, he's like, "I gotta
